From 74d4c21f8b47e39937e297ac134b2800f6bd59fb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sn3ro <zak.darek@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 08:30:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] test(ui): guard against new colour literals outside the
 theme tokens

A new test walks crates/ui/src and counts the colour literals in each
file that is not a test file. Each count must equal its row in an
allow-list: a new literal fails, and a moved literal fails until its
row is lowered. Each row says why it is kept, or which #1120 family PR
moves it to theme tokens. On main the list has 31 files and 162
literals.

Refs #1120

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
